    "created_at": "2026-01-07T13:39:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-07T13:39:33Z",
    "body": "I think that might also be ambiguous, e.g., is order now important? We'd also have to define what correspondence means and such. I went with my fix for now, but if you're keen to propose an alternative as a PR I'm open to reviewing it.",
