    "created_at": "2026-01-09T02:23:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-09T02:23:14Z",
    "body": "I think that [one-to-one correspondence](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One-to-one_correspondence) is a well known term with a specific meaning.\n\nHow about this version: \"If A is an element, each attribute in its attribute list equals an attribute in B's attribute list, and vice versa.\" This way it is clear that B cannot have attributes that A doesn't also have.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
